OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely cloudy start, with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain and drizzle moving
OL,7,Fnorth through the morning. Rain could
OL,8,Fbe heavy over the Pennines initially.
OL,9,FRemaining cloudy with further rain
OL,10,Fthough the afternoon, but perhaps
OL,11,Fbecoming drier from the south. Breezy.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with spells of rain
OL,14,Fagain through the evening, becoming
OL,15,Fheavy over western hills. Rain will
OL,16,Fgradually move westward overnight,
OL,17,Fbecoming dry along eastern coasts.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
